    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n*** Email Enquiries Only***\n\nDNG Duffy is pleased to present 116 Ath Lethan to the rental market. Nestled within the highly sought-after development of Ath Lethan, this impressive and imposing four bedroom detached property exudes contemporary elegance and offers spacious living accommodation throughout.\n\nConstructed with striking red brick, this attractive property has plenty to offer, including the added bonus of a matching, standalone garage complete with a roller door.\n\nUpon entering the home, you are greeted by a spacious entrance hallway featuring a double height ceiling. Just off to the left is a bright living room, which includes a fireplace with a fitted provision for an electric fire feature. To the rear of the hallway is an expansive, open plan kitchen and dining area. This space includes a fully integrated kitchen with a breakfast bar, alongside a dining and family area with double french doors that lead directly into the fully enclosed rear garden. The ground floor is completed by a separate utility room offering direct access to the rear of the property, as well as a guest WC.\n\nUpstairs, the expansive landing creates a cosy corner and seating area. The master bedroom boasts its own ensuite bathroom, while the three additional bedrooms each feature a sliderobe offering ample storage space. A main family bathroom serves this level, offering added comfort and convenience."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGround Floor - \n\n\nHall - 3.5m x 1.5m\n\n\nWC - 2.0m x 1.5m\n\n\nLiving Room - 5.0m x 4.0m\n\n\nKitchen/Diner Room - 9.0m x 4.9m\n\n\nUtility Room - 2.1m x 2.5m\n\n\nSecond Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 6.9m x 4.3m\n\n\nBed Room 1 - 3.9m x 3.7m\nEn Suite 2.8m x 1.5m\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.3m x 3.6m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.7m x 3.7m\n\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.0m x 3.7m\n\n\nMain Bathroom - 2.m x 1.8m\n\n\nHotpress - 1.0m x 1.2m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Gas fired central heating</li><li> Gas fire in the living room</li><li> Triple glazed windows and doors</li><li> Wooden flooring</li><li> On site car parking</li><li> Close to the racetrack, shops, public transport, bars, take aways etc</li><li> M2 only 1.2 miles away</ul>"
      },
